        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>China Daily Vocabulary</title>\n  <script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n  <script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #fff;\n      color: #276382;\n      font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 0 12px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .top-rule {\n      height: 4px;\n      background: #d5d5d5;\n      margin: 0 -4px 1px;\n    }\n    .masthead {\n      height: 62px;\n      position: relative;\n      padding-top: 1px;\n    }\n    .logo {\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 40px;\n      line-height: 41px;\n      letter-spacing: -2px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #00588b;\n    }\n    .logo span {\n      color: #88a7bd;\n    }\n    .brand-sub {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 42px;\n      left: 1px;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", serif;\n      font-size: 7px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #3b6d88;\n      letter-spacing: 3px;\n    }\n    .site {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 46px;\n      left: 76px;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 4px;\n      color: #333;\n    }\n    .passage {\n      border: 1px solid #377fa7;\n      background: #e5f0f6;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 62% 38%;\n      min-height: 168px;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      line-height: 1.85;\n    }\n    .passage .english {\n      padding: 4px 4px 3px;\n      border-right: 1px solid #5f9aba;\n      letter-spacing: .15px;\n    }\n    .passage .chinese {\n      padding: 3px 5px;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", SimSun, serif;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      font-weight: normal;\n      line-height: 1.85;\n      color: #316787;\n    }\n    .red { color: #bd7975; }\n    .entries {\n      margin-left: 74px;\n      width: 365px;\n      padding-top: 1px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.9;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .entry { margin: 0 0 2px; }\n    .head {\n      min-height: 25px;\n      color: #2e6684;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .number {\n      display: inline-block;\n      width: 28px;\n      color: #bd7f76;\n    }\n    .meaning {\n      padding-left: 0;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .example {\n      font-style: italic;\n      color: #36708d;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .indent {\n      padding-left: 20px;\n    }\n    .highlight {\n      display: inline-block;\n      background: #fff2a7;\n      line-height: 20px;\n      padding: 0 2px;\n    }\n    .commission-line {\n      margin-left: 28px;\n    }\n    .last {\n      margin-top: 1px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"top-rule\"></div>\n    <header class=\"masthead\">\n      <div class=\"logo\">CHINA<span>DAILY</span></div>\n      <div class=\"brand-sub\">中国日报</div>\n      <div class=\"site\">www.chinadaily.com.cn</div>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"passage\">\n      <div class=\"english\">\n        began to get a little less dark in 1477, when<br>\n        Archduke Maximilian of Austria <span class=\"red\">commissioned[5]</span><br>\n        an extravagant diamond ring for his new wife. The<br>\n        <span class=\"red\">accessory[6]</span> grew in popularity in the Victorian era,<br>\n        and gradually the diamond ring trend <span class=\"red\">trickled</span><br>\n        <span class=\"red\">down[7]</span> from nobility to the masses.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"chinese\">\n        米兰至公给新婚妻子定制了一<br>\n        枚奢侈的钻石戒指，自那以后<br>\n        订婚戒指的含义就变得那么明暗<br>\n        了。订婚戒指在维多利亚时代<br>\n        变得越发流行，订婚结成的习<br>\n        俗也从贵族流传到了民间。\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <main class=\"entries\">\n      <section class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"number\">[1]</span>twisted　美 /'twistid/</div>\n        <div class=\"meaning\">adj. mentally or emotionally unsound or disturbed　扭曲的</div>\n        <div class=\"example\">She gave a small twisted smile.　她不不自然地微微一笑。</div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"number\">[2]</span>gem　美 /dʒem/</div>\n        <div class=\"meaning\">n. (also gemstone) a precious stone that has been cut and</div>\n        <div class=\"meaning\">polished and is used in jewellery（经切割打磨的）宝石</div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"number\">[3]</span>anthropologist　美 /,ænθrə'pɔ:ləʤist/　n. 人类学家</div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"number\">[4]</span>date back to /dɪt bæk...　追溯；始于；自......至今</div>\n        <div class=\"example indent\">The college dates back to medieval times.</div>\n        <div class=\"example indent\">这所学院创办于中世纪。</div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"entry\">\n        <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"number\">[5]</span><span class=\"highlight\">commission　熟词释义</span></div>\n        <div class=\"commission-line\"><span class=\"highlight\">v. to officially ask sb to write, make or create sth or to do a</span></div>\n        <div class=\"commission-line\"><span class=\"highlight\">task for you　正式委托（谱写或制作、创作、完成）</span></div>\n        <div class=\"example\">Publishers have commissioned a French translation of the book.</div>\n        <div class=\"example\">出版社委托人把这本书译成法语。</div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"entry last\">\n        <div class=\"head\"><span class=\"number\">[6]</span>accessory　美 /ək'sesəri/</div>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
